WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Your memory. Two kinds of record, kept on your computer: everything said, and the things worth keeping from it.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Pin the things you would otherwise repeat.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.200
A memory kept as a task stays under Open tasks until it is done.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:18.665
Tell one of them something, and the others can find it.

00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:29.275
MindToo finds what you meant even when none of your words match.

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:32.875
When nothing it holds answers the question, it says so plainly, rather than guessing.

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:38.745
Tell any assistant it has something wrong, and the correction replaces it for all of them.

00:00:38.745 --> 00:00:42.345
The old version stays under Earlier versions, so nothing is lost by being corrected.

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:48.220
An assistant cannot destroy anything.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.420
It leaves recall and the lists, and stays under Archived, where you can restore it.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.420
MindToo. Your memory. privateai.ltd/mindtoo/manual/memory/

